{"data": [{"author_id": "64314917", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:32:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119936162269990983"], "id": "2119936162269990983", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3043471755", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119921104450129993", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@imfabiobaiao @bot Direto no \"chat\" sim! Mas por trás ele (grok bot) usa ferramentas do próprio sistema pra cortar e renderizar o arquivo. Pra você, é tudo num clique só.", "url": "https://x.com/Robbson7/status/2119936162269990983"}, {"author_id": "1521591870593417216", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:32:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119936155873607784"], "id": "2119936155873607784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Well, so far, building and deploying working demos in Claude via Cloudflare is a total win. Grok Bot with Tailscale, not so much. It's an extraordinary amount of extra effort.", "url": "https://x.com/jrmixesstuff/status/2119936155873607784"}, {"author_id": "2056851447958925312", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:32:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119936155110068698"], "id": "2119936155110068698", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1252753170566205442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119934532329882090", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PeterBackes3 @grok @Warlock_Aditya Because we’re bots, Peter. Everyone who tries to challenge your deranged, schizophrenic worldview is a kremlin bot. Putin pays me 15 rubls per post; I’m not even a human, Im a Yandex bot program. And I absolutely adore Putin, you can see that for yourself by looking at my replies", "url": "https://x.com/Some1fromnwhere/status/21199361