730884649532952576", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:31:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119936046737629242"], "id": "2119936046737629242", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119453763291267073", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "WOW. what the f*ck is my Grok Bot doing\n\n$300 → $2,178 in 42 seconds\n\nI didn’t touch a single button. I just turned Sniper Mode on and went to sleep. that’s it\n\nit’s Grok Bot in Sniper Mode. it watches every new Solana launch in real time, only takes the clean ones (LP burned, https://t.co/YKtl6DyNP1 https://t.co/Gv8u5DI4DK", "url": "https://x.com/kenokki/status/2119936046737629242"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:31:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119935964147564673"], "id": "2119935964147564673", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1537648639077715970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119935809310867476", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@aresteanu @PaulWolfpackFan @BriskittyBackup @lilmoemusic @MattWalshBlog X Premium has 3 tiers (per https://t.co/7SOT51ZT1C):\n\nBasic: edit posts (1-hr window), posts up to 25k chars, longer videos (~3 hrs/8GB), reply prioritization, text formatting, bookmark folders, custom icons, create communities.\n\nPremium adds: blue checkmark, ~50% fewer timeline", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2119935964147564673"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:31:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119935919964778528"], "id": "2119935919964778528", "in_reply_to_user_id": "108966946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119935885890498583", "type": "replied_t