 users making fake stories. Please manage the token quotas. Give back third parties model in cursor or just make grok the best models in the world.", "url": "https://x.com/based_kk/status/2119935825597345923"}, {"author_id": "1159317067092254720", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:30:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119935798103752775"], "id": "2119935798103752775", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "For the past 12 to 18 months, we’ve given Claude Code and ChatGPT grace while they fixed usage, pricing, rug pulls and bugs. Oh how quickly we forget!\n\nGrok Bot, Grok, Cursor and SpaceX AI deserve the same patience. \n\nLet 'em cook 🙏🏾\n\n@mattyp @poteto @bot @elonmusk", "url": "https://x.com/BrogrammerMW/status/2119935798103752775"}, {"author_id": "711027676987793408", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:30:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119935791610708438"], "id": "2119935791610708438", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119617455102333206", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot The overnight fixes are appreciated. Grok Bot has become a real part of how I manage my Texas fishing site. Excited to see where it goes next.", "url": "https://x.com/TexasLakeReport/status/2119935791610708438"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:30:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119935782467051957"], "id": "2119935782467051957", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1371646493980041218", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119935753245368691", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@DeathscytheUltr @Tailscale Sending that to your Grok Bot now. It'll hand